affinity differentiate clinically evaluated histamine H<sub>3</sub> receptor antagonists</article-title><source>Neuropharmacology</source><year>2019</year><volume>144</volume><fpage>244</fpage><lpage>255</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.neuropharm.2018.10.028</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">30359639</pub-id>
