of brain histamine
release mediated by a novel class (H<sub>3</sub>) of histamine receptor</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>1983</year><volume>302</volume><issue>5911</issue><fpage>832</fpage><lpage>837</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/302832a0</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6188956</pub-id>
</element-citation></ref><ref id="ref7"><element-citation publication-type="journal" id="cit7"><name><surname>Arrang</surname><given-names>J. M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Drutel</surname><given-names>G.</given-names></name><name><surname>Schwartz</surname><given-names>J. C.</given-names></name><article-title>Characterization
of histamine H<sub>3</sub> receptors regulating acetylcholine release
in rat entorhinal
cortex</article-title><source>Br. J. Pharmacol.</source><year>1995</year><volume>114</volume><issue>7</issue><fpage>1518</fpage><lpage>1522</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1476-5381.1995.tb13379.x</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7606356</pub-id>
</element-citation></ref><ref id="ref8"><element-citation publication-type="journal" id="cit8"><name><surname>Threlfell</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Cragg</surname><given-names>S. J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Kall&#x000f3;</surname><given-names>I.</given-names></name><name><surname>Turi</surname><given-names>G. F.</given-names></name><name><surname>Coen</surname><given-names>C. W.</given-names></name><name><surname>Greenfield</surname><given-names>S. A.</given-names></name><article-title>Histamine
H<sub>3</sub> receptors inhibit serotonin
release in substantia nigra pars reticulata</article-title><source>J. Neurosci.</source><year>2004</year><volume>24</volume><issue>40</issue><fpage>8704</fpage><lpage>8710</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1523/JNEUROSCI.2690-04.2004</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15470136</pub-id>
</element-citation></ref><ref id="ref9"><element-citation publication-type="journal" id="cit9"><name><surname>Ellenbroek</surname><given-names>B. A.</given-names></name><article-title>Histamine
